<title>JAPAN: Japan Dec rubber output for tyres up 3.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Dec rubber output for tyres up 3.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese rubber output for tyres totalled 89,031 tonnes in December, up 3.7 percent from the same month the previous year but down 6.7 percent from November, the Japan Automobile Tyre Manufacturers' Association said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Domestic rubber shipments in December amounted to 51,197 tonnes, up 8.3 percent from the previous year but down 12.6 percent from November, the industry body said.</p>
<p>Exports of rubber for tyres in December totalled 36,572 tonnes, down 0.6 percent from the same month a year earlier but up 0.6 percent from November, it said.</p>
</text>
